                <pb facs="1109" n="989" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg989"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Hutchinson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-08-08"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 8,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hutchinson reports that the final decision in Hamilton suit on the 7th
                    confirms all the points of the lower court, including costs. Requests Department
                    to advise Bermudez Company.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
